# Contact Sheet {#contact_sheet}

Generate a single thumbnail grid image showing every Nth frame.

## Settings
• [b]Every Nth frame[/b] — e.g., 100 = every 100th frame (default)
• [b]Thumbnail size[/b] — Width/height in pixels (default 128)
• [b]Show labels[/b] — Draw frame index below each thumbnail

## Example
For a 45,000 frame archive with N=100:
• 450 thumbnails in a grid
• At 128px each, approximately 3000x2000 pixel output image

## Access
• Menu: [b]Export → Generate Contact Sheet...[/b]
• Shortcut: [b]Ctrl+Shift+C[/b]

