# Split Archive {#split_archive}

Split a large archive into smaller parts.

## Split by Frame Range
• Specify frames per part (e.g., 5000)
• Output: [b]basename.iar001[/b], [b]basename.iar002[/b], etc.

## Split by GOP Boundaries
• Specify GOPs per part (e.g., 50)
• Splits at GOP boundaries to maintain clean keyframe references
• Output: same .iar001, .iar002 naming

## Important Notes
• Maximum 999 parts
• Frames at split boundaries with parents in other parts are promoted to keyframes
• Each part is a fully independent .iarc-compatible archive

## Access
• Menu: [b]Export → Split Archive (by range/GOP)...[/b]

[link:toc]↑ Back to Table of Contents[/link]

