# Batch Builder {#batch_builder}

Build multiple archives from multiple folders in one session.

## How to Use
1. Open: [b]Tools → Batch Archive Builder...[/b]
2. Click [color:cyan]Add Folder[/color] to queue source folders
3. Each folder auto-gets an output .iarc path
4. Click [color:green]Build All[/color] to process sequentially
5. All folders use the current analysis settings

## Notes
• A .ias project file is auto-saved alongside each archive
• Each completed archive is added to Recent Files
• Progress shows per-folder status
• Can be cancelled between folders

[link:toc]↑ Back to Table of Contents[/link]

