# Project Files (.ias) {#project_files}

A [b].ias[/b] project file stores the session state for an archive.

## What is Stored
• Source folder path
• Archive file path
• Audio file path (for video export)
• All build settings (quality, GOP, thresholds, toggles)
• Export settings (FPS, format)
• Contact sheet settings
• Bookmarks and tags
• Creation and modification timestamps

## Automatic Behavior
• When you build an archive, a .ias file is auto-created alongside it
• When you open a .iarc file, the app looks for a matching .ias and auto-loads it
• Settings from the .ias override current app settings for that archive

## Manual Save/Load
• [b]File → Save Project[/b] (Ctrl+S)
• [b]File → Open Project (.ias)...[/b] (Ctrl+Shift+O)

## File Format
Plain JSON with .ias extension. Human-readable and editable.

