# Compact & Repair {#compact_repair}

## Compact Archive
[b]What it does:[/b]
• Removes all deleted frames permanently
• Rebuilds a clean, contiguous archive
• Remaps all frame indices and parent references
• Creates a backup before modifying

[b]When to use:[/b]
• After deleting many frames
• To reduce file size
• Before sharing an archive

## Repair Archive
[b]What it does:[/b]
• Validates every stored keyframe blob (decode test)
• Validates every residual blob
• Checks parent references for all interpolated frames
• Fixes orphaned frames (missing parents)
• Demotes corrupted keyframes to interpolated
• Promotes orphaned frames to keyframes when possible
• Rebuilds index and compacts

[b]What it reports:[/b]
[mono]
Corrupted keyframes:      count
Corrupted residuals:      count
Orphaned frames:          count
Fixed frames:             count
Promoted to keyframe:     count
Demoted to interpolated:  count
Unrecoverable:            count
[/mono]

